f the matrix $L.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ \\,\\,1\\,\\, & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ \\,\\,1\\,\\, & -1 & 3 \\\\ \\,\\,0\\,\\, & \\,-3\\, & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\nL=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,U=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${l}_{21}=1$ and ${u}_{33}=-1,$ we get\n\n$$\n{l}_{21}\\cdot {u}_{33}=1\\cdot (-1)=-1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1bf123ec-c601-5371-b17f-97ffe6f5c56c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1bf123ec-c601-5371-b17f-97ffe6f5c56c" :answer-field/id #uuid "1bf123ec-c601-5371-b17f-97ffe6f5c56c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-def3a16e-877c-5ac0-ad20-f7c4ea03de40" :answer-field/choices ["answer-def3a16e-877c-5ac0-ad20-f7c4ea03de40" "answer-df519c42-b224-5f30-949f-fbded56d0956" "answer-136c449c-f017-52df-a684-4a77861293e7" "answer-a68ca580-41ea-57ec-8b83-0d07b5a4a775" "answer-311bb2cb-1c16-509e-a16f-ac3c2eabb459"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-def3a16e-877c-5ac0-ad20-f7c4ea03de40" :answer/id #uuid "def3a16e-877c-5ac0-ad20-f7c4ea03de40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-df519c42-b224-5f30-949f-fbded56d0956" :answer/id #uuid "df519c42-b224-5f30-949f-fbded56d0956" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-136c449c-f017-52df-a684-4a77861293e7" :answer/id #uuid "136c449c-f017-52df-a684-4a77861293e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate